# hexleyBoot Runtime Variables
# NOTE: Jumps in Minor Revisions -> Can no longer boot on latest resources.
# Resources are: Frameworks, Modules, Drivers.
# You will be required to downgrade these resources to boot older kernels.
# The codename of the Kernel signifies which release resources you will require.

# KERNEL="hexleyCore-v3.0.0"
KERNEL="hexleyDuo-v3.1.0"
